                <div class="policy-content fade-in">
                    <div class="highlight-box">
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-red-700 mb-3">NO REFUNDS POLICY</h3>
                        <p class="text-red-700 font-semibold">UPIExpress does not provide refunds for any subscription plans, services, or payments made through our platform.</p>
                        <p class="text-gray-700 mt-2">By purchasing any of our services, you acknowledge and agree to this no-refund policy.</p>
