                    <h2>Policy Details</h2>
                    <h3>Subscription Plans</h3>
                    <p>All subscription plans (monthly, quarterly, or annual) are non-refundable. This includes:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Monthly subscription fees</li>
                        <li>Annual subscription fees</li>
                        <li>Any plan upgrades or downgrades</li>
                        <li>Additional service charges</li>
                    </ul>

                    <h3>Service Usage</h3>
                    <p>Once a subscription is activated, the service period begins immediately. We do not provide:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Partial refunds for unused portions of subscription periods</li>
                        <li>Refunds for early cancellation</li>
                        <li>Refunds for changing your mind about the service</li>
                        <li>Refunds for not using the service</li>
                    </ul>

                    <h3>Cancellation Policy</h3>
                    <p>You may cancel your subscription at any time through your account dashboard. However:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Cancellation does not entitle you to a refund of any payments already made</li>
                        <li>Your service will remain active until the end of your current billing period</li>
                        <li>No further charges will be made after cancellation</li>
                    </ul>

                    <div class="info-card rounded-xl p-6 my-8">
                        <div class="flex items-start">
                            <div class="bg-blue-100 p-3 rounded-lg mr-4">
                                <i class="fas fa-lightbulb text-blue-600 text-xl"></i>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-2">Before You Purchase</h3>
                                <p class="text-gray-700 mb-3">We strongly recommend:</p>
                                <ul class="list-disc pl-5 text-gray-700">
                                    <li>Using our free trial to test the service</li>
                                    <li>Reviewing our documentation and features</li>
                                    <li>Contacting support with any questions</li>
                                    <li>Ensuring our service meets your requirements</li>
                                </ul>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <h2>Technical Issues</h2>
                    <p>If you experience technical issues with our service:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Contact our support team immediately for assistance</li>
                        <li>We will work diligently to resolve any technical problems</li>
                        <li>Service credits or extensions may be provided for significant service disruptions at our discretion</li>
                        <li>Refunds will not be issued for technical issues</li>
                    </ul>

                    <h2>Exceptional Circumstances</h2>
                    <p>While our policy is strict, we understand that exceptional situations may occur. In rare cases, we may consider:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Service credits for future periods (at our sole discretion)</li>
                        <li>Extensions to your service period</li>
                        <li>Resolution of billing errors or duplicate charges</li>
                    </ul>
                    <p class="mt-4 text-gray-600"><strong>Note:</strong> Any such consideration is entirely at our discretion and does not establish a precedent for future cases.</p>

                    <h2>Contact for Billing Inquiries</h2>
                    <p>If you have questions about our refund policy or need assistance with billing:</p>
                    
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mt-6">
                        <div class="policy-card rounded-xl p-6">
                            <div class="flex items-start">
                                <div class="bg-[var(--primary)] p-3 rounded-lg mr-4">
                                    <i class="fas fa-envelope text-white text-xl"></i>
                                </div>
                                <div>
                                    <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-2">Email Support</h3>
                                    <p class="text-gray-600 mb-2">For billing inquiries and policy questions:</p>
                                    <a href="mailto:billing@upiexpress.com"
                                        class="text-[var(--primary)] font-medium hover:underline">billing@upiexpress.com</a>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="policy-card rounded-xl p-6">
                            <div class="flex items-start">
                                <div class="bg-[var(--primary)] p-3 rounded-lg mr-4">
                                    <i class="fas fa-clock text-white text-xl"></i>
                                </div>
                                <div>
                                    <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-2">Support Hours</h3>
