                                    <ul class="text-gray-600">
                                    <li>Monday to Friday: 10:00 AM - 11:00 PM</li>
                                        
                                    </ul>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <h2>Policy Acknowledgment</h2>
                    <p>By purchasing any UPIExpress service, you acknowledge that:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>You have read and understood this refund policy</li>
                        <li>You agree to the no-refund terms</li>
                        <li>You accept full responsibility for your purchase decisions</li>
                        <li>You will not initiate chargebacks or payment disputes</li>
                    </ul>

                    <h2>Policy Changes</h2>
